      "content": "idk i'm just feeling really anxious about it. if i just take some more ibuprofen and use a heating pad will that help it settle down? i'd really rather just try to sleep it off tonight and see if i feel better in the morning. is there anything i can do at home to manage the pain or reduce the swelling just for tonight?",
